Package: MedStat3D
Title: Statistical Visualisation for Segmented Medical Imaging Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(given = "MedStat3D", family = "Team",
           email = "maintainer@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a common interface for validating statistical results
    indexed to segmented medical-imaging regions and displaying them on
    organ-specific three-dimensional atlas meshes. Atlas geometry and renderers
    are deliberately separate from the statistical-data contract so that new
    organs can be added without changing the user-facing workflow.
